OL,3,GNEWSAApartment block evacuated after
OL,4,Awater leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of people have been evacuated
OL,7,Ffrom an apartment block in Nottingham
OL,8,Fafter a water leak impacted the
OL,9,Fbuilding's lifts and fire alarm
OL,10,Fsystems.
OL,12,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,13,Fsaid it was made aware of the leak at
OL,14,FCranbrook House, in Cranbrook Street,
OL,15,Fon Friday and began evacuating
OL,16,Fresidents at about 00:00 BST on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,19,FThe leak was across three floors of the
OL,20,Fbuilding, the fire service added.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
